        "id": 158280,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-31T19:27:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't know what hands you got for the heroes but a priority for me would be Infrared Eyepiece on Wraith so you can manage what is coming up. &nbsp; Stunning Bolt is also effective to use as only Plague Rats end of turn damage is irreducible. &nbsp; A great card to have in hand after Plague Rat has flipped is Fueled Freeze from AZ.</p><p>A general<span>&nbsp;tip I would have in this game is to take Plague Locus as soon as possible. &nbsp;A three hero team just can't take advantage as well of the bonus infected damage. &nbsp;Of his Ongoings Afflicted Frenzy is the one to get rid of when you can.&nbsp;</span></p>",
