      {
        "id": 158284,
        "name": "fabikw",
        "username": "fabikw",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/ea5d25/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-31T22:25:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>With Ra against Plague Rat, the best strategy is to turn all hero damage into fire (Imbued Fire) and then use the power in Flesh of The Sun God to make all the heroes immune to fire. That may not play too well with AZ, and will reduce the damage output of Ra, but it will prevent all the self damage done by Infected heroes.</p><p>In particular, if you flip Plague Rat, you can use the infected powers to heal and destroy other infections.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:38:22.463Z",
