      {
        "id": 158285,
        "name": "PeterCHayward",
        "username": "PeterCHayward",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/peterchayward/{size}/2098_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-31T23:28:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had a pretty hilarious setup where Ra was the only non-incapacitated hero, and had Imbued Fire, Flesh of the Sun God and Flame Barrier out. Each turn went:</p><p>Ra: play (whatever), throw Staff of Ra at Plague Rat.</p><p>Incap Wraith: Return Staff of Ra to play.</p><p>Absolute Zero: Ra uses a power to heal.</p><p>He was never damaging himself, despite being infected (and regardless of how many afflicted attacks came out) and was just doing huge amounts of damage through his cards, Staff of Ra and Flame Barrier.</p>",
